[00:00.81]Lesson 101 | 第101课
[00:04.29]A card from Jimmy | 吉米的明信片
[00:07.43]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.94]Does grandmother seem pleased to get a card from Jimmy? Why/Why not? | 奶奶似乎对收到吉米的明信片感到高兴吗?为什么/为什么不?
[00:23.61]Read Jimmy's card to me please, Penny. | 彭尼,请把吉米的明信片念给我听。
[00:28.94]'I have just arrived in Scotland and I'm staying at a Youth Hostel.' | '我刚到苏格兰,我住在一家青年旅舍。'
[00:37.16]Eh? | 嗯?
[00:38.97]He says he's just arrived in Scotland. | 他说他刚到苏格兰。
[00:44.04]He says he's staying at a Youth Hostel. | 他说他住在一家青年旅舍。
[00:49.41]You know he's a member of the Y.H.A. | 你知道他是青年旅舍协会的会员。
[00:56.34]The what? | 什么协会?
[00:58.18]The Y.H.A., Mum. | 青年旅舍协会,妈妈。
[01:01.31]The Youth Hostels Association. | 青年旅舍协会。
[01:05.82]What else does he say? | 他还会说什么?
[01:09.36]'I'll write a letter soon. | '我很快会写信。
[01:12.45]I hope you are all well.' | 我希望你们都身体健康。'
[01:16.64]What? Speak up, Penny. | 什么?说大声点,彭尼。
[01:20.30]I'm afraid I can't hear you. | 恐怕我听不见你说话。
[01:24.20]He says he'll write a letter soon. | 他说他很快会写信。
[01:28.45]He hopes we are all well. | 他希望我们都身体健康。
[01:32.60]'Love, Jimmy.' | '爱你们的吉米。'
[01:35.71]Is that all? | 就这些吗?
[01:37.91]He doesn't say very much, does he? | 他说得不多,是吗?
[01:42.43]He can't write very much on a card, Mum. | 他在明信片上写不了太多,妈妈。